  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction and Equipping of Three Regional Hospitals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving the health status and reducing the prevalence of endemic diseases in three regions in Sudan through establishing a new specialist hospital in Kassala town, completing and upgrading the existing rural hospital in El_Zareeba village, and establishing a new rural hospital in Ni&apos;ema Village.</narrative>
  </description>
